# www -> apex, 301.
#
# The site declares the apex as canonical in <link rel="canonical">, og:url and
# sitemap.xml, so www must not serve a second copy of everything.
#
# Doing it here rather than as a Cloudflare Redirect Rule keeps the behaviour in
# the repo, where it is reviewable and travels with the project. :splat carries
# the rest of the path through.

https://www.iterventions.com/*  https://iterventions.com/:splat  301
